 "remarks": "Enjoy the best of in-town living in this beautifully updated Middlesex Commons townhouse, ideally located within walking distance of town, Metro-North and Whole Foods. With the Corbin District bringing even more shopping, dining and gathering spaces nearby, this home offers a wonderful combination of convenience, comfort and community.  Inside, an inviting foyer opens to a spacious living and dining room, where soaring two-story windows fill the space with natural light. A fireplace creates a warm focal point, while sliding doors lead to a private, west-facing deck overlooking beautifully landscaped open space. The bright eat-in kitchen enjoys southeastern exposure and lovely morning light. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite features a cathedral ceiling, half-moon window, private balcony and generous bath with separate tub and shower. A second bedroom also offers a cathedral ceiling and half-moon window, along with a full bath. Designed with today's flexible lifestyles in mind, the home offers exceptional additional space: an extended hallway provides an efficient home-office area, while a bonus room can serve as a second office, den, hobby room or other flexible space. Ample storage adds to the home's practicality. Set on 11 beautiful acres with sweeping lawns, a picturesque pond, heated saltwater pool & pool house, plus a charming guest cottage. With so much just a short walk away, this is an opportunity to enjoy a residential setting and the convenience of town!",
